==Wise Trio==
Exclusively in {{game|Crystal}}, a group of three sages, Gaku, Masa, and Koji, guard at the highest floor of the [[Ecruteak City#Barrier Station to Bell Tower|Barrier Station]] to [[Bellchime Trail]] in [[Ecruteak City]]. They battle the player before allowing passage. Once the [[Player character|player]] has defeated them, they appear at the [[Bell Tower]] and tell stories of the two towers and the [[Legendary beasts]].

For their quotes, see: ''[[Wise Trio/Quotes]]''

